OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions
OL,4,
OL,5,FJohn Swinney will face questions from
OL,6,Fbackbench MSPs for half an hour from
OL,7,Fabout 14.30
OL,9,FAfter FMQs there will be two
